# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Secrets — never commit.
# .env is currently TRACKED and holds only publishable/anon keys, which are
# designed to be public. It is intentionally NOT force-removed here, since that
# would break existing local setups. These rules stop any NEW secret file from
# being committed. See GOVERNANCE.md §6.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
service-account*.json

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
